    }
  ],
  "limits": [
    "No runtime, Cargo, imports, formatter, lint/checker or resource probes executed.",
    "Literal UDP readiness is not authenticated H3 handshake evidence.",
    "Poison, late publication beyond backup deadline, panic/send/client-primary/sniffer outcomes are not covered by these two controls.",
    "Actual completed I/O errors are installed at the real Pending read boundary after network readiness; no operating-system fault claim.",
    "No whole parent/crate/runtime review; fresh full reads are only226 new child,237 observer,267 retained backup/exchange. Other five-file identity checks are preservation evidence, not fresh manual coverage.",
    "Previously reviewed shared ConnectionPeer/FixtureFailures contract is retained; no new transitive coverage claim.",
    "All intended failures and downstream type/identity conditions are forecasts until root paired execution."
  ],
